     "html": "<div class=\"callout\"><p>1-masala. Aksiya bir yildan keyin 12 ming so‘m dividend beradi va 110 ming so‘mga</p></div><div class=\"callout\"><p>sotilishi kutilmoqda. Foiz stavkasi 20%. Arbitraj yo‘qligi shartiga ko‘ra aksiyaning</p></div><div class=\"callout\"><p>bugungi narxi qancha?</p></div><div class=\"callout callout-calc\"><p><b>Yechish.</b></p><p>p0=(12+110)/1,2=101,67 ming so‘m.</p></div><div class=\"callout\"><p>2-masala. O‘rmon qiymati F (t )=100√t (mln so‘m), foiz stavkasi 5%. Optimal kesish</p></div><div class=\"callout\"><p>vaqtini toping.</p></div><div class=\"callout callout-calc\"><p><b>Yechish.</b></p><p>F ′/F= 50/√t 100√t=1 2t=0,05, bundan T=10 yil (uzluksiz diskontlash farazi</p></div><p>ostida).</p><p>3-masala. Iste’molchi naflilik funksiyasi u=ln w, boyligi 100. U 50% ehtimol bilan 36 yutadigan va 50% ehtimol bilan 36 yutqazadigan o‘yinda qatnashishi taklif qilindi.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Risk mukofotini aniq va Errou–Pratt formulasi bo‘yicha taxminiy hisoblang.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Yechish.EU=0,5ln136+0,5ln 64=0,5 (4 ,9127+4 ,1589)=4 ,5358; C E=e</td><td>4 ,5358=93,30;</td></tr><tr><td>R P=100−93,30=6,70. Taxminiy: rA=1/100, σ</td><td>2=1296; R P≈0,5⋅0,01⋅1296=6,48.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Taxminiy formula yaxshi yaqinlashish beradi.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>4-masala. Investor U=μ−2σ</td><td>2 naflilik funksiyasiga ega. rf=0,08, rm=0,16, σ m=0,2.</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Riskli aktivga qo‘yiladigan optimal ulush x ni toping.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Yechish.</td><td>μ=0,08+0,08 x,</td><td>σ</td><td>2=0,04 x</td><td>2.</td><td>U=0,08+0,08 x−0,08 x</td><td>2.</td></tr><tr><td>d U /d x=0,08−0,16 x=0, x</td><td>*=0,5. Investor mablag‘ining yarmini riskli aktivga</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>qo‘yadi; portfel daromadliligi 12%, riski 10%.</p>"
