     "title": "6.7. Yechib ko‘rsatilgan masalalar",
     "html": "<p>1-masala. Talab Q=100−2 P, taklif Q=3 P−50. a) Muvozanatda CS va PS ni toping. b) t=10 soliq joriy etilsa, xaridor va sotuvchi narxlarini, soliq tushumini va DWL ni</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>toping.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Yechish. a) 100−2 P=3 P−50, P</td><td>*=30, Q</td><td>*=40. Talab nolga teng: P=50; taklif nolga</td></tr><tr><td>teng:</td><td>P=50/3.</td><td>C S=0,5⋅40⋅20=400;</td><td>P S=0,5⋅40⋅(30−16,67)=266,7. b)</td></tr><tr><td>100−2 Pb=3(Pb−10)−50,</td><td>5 Pb=180,</td><td>Pb=36,</td><td>Ps=26,</td><td>Qt=28. Tushum</td><td>280;</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>DW L=0,5⋅10⋅12=60. Soliq yukining 6/10=60% i xaridorga tushdi, chunki talab taklifdan noelastikroq.</p><p>2-masala. Kvazichiziqli naflilik u=20√x+ y bo‘lgan iste’molchi uchun x narxi 2 dan 4 ga oshdi. Iste’molchi ortiqchaligining o‘zgarishini toping va u CV hamda EV ga</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>tengligini tushuntiring.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Yechish.</td><td>Teskari</td><td>talab</td><td>p=10/√x,</td><td>talab</td><td>x=100/ p</td><td>2.</td></tr><tr><td>4ΔC S=−∫ 2</td><td>100 p</td><td>−2d p=−100 (1/2−1/4 )=−25. Kvazichiziqli naflilikda daromad</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>samarasi yo‘q, shuning uchun C V =EV =25.</p><p>3-masala. Talab elastikligi −0,5, taklif elastikligi 1,5. Aktsiz 1 000 so‘m bo‘lsa, xaridor narxi qancha oshadi?</p><p class=\"formula\">Yechish.Δ Pb=t ⋅ 1,5 1,5+0,5=750 so‘m; sotuvchi narxi 250 so‘mga kamayadi. Yukning</p><div class=\"callout\"><p>75% i xaridorga tushadi.</p></div>"
