     "title": "8.9. Yechib ko‘rsatilgan masalalar",
     "html": "<p>1-masala. Monopolist talabi Q=120−2 P, xarajatlari TC=300+10Q+0,5Q 2. Optimal narx, hajm, foyda va DWL ni toping (raqobat bilan solishtirish uchun P=MC).</p><p>Yechish.P=60−0,5Q, MR=60−Q, MC=10+Q. 60−Q=10+Q, Qm=25, Pm=47 ,5.</p><p>TC=300+250+312,5=862,5; T R=1187 ,5; π=325. Raqobat: 60−0,5Q=10+Q, Qc=33,3, Pc=43,3. DWL *0,5⋅(Qc−Qm)⋅(Pm−MC (Qm))=0,5⋅8,33⋅(47 ,5−35)=52,1 .</p><p>2-masala. Uch firmali Kurno oligopoliyasi: P=100−Q, MC=10. Muvozanatni toping.</p><p>Yechish.qi=(a−c)/[(n+1)b)=90/4=22,5; Q=67,5; P=32,5; har bir firma foydasi 22,5⋅22,5=506,25. Solishtirish: monopoliyada Q=45, P=55; raqobatda Q=90, P=10 .</p><p>3-masala. Monopolist ikki bozorda sotadi: ichki bozor ε1=−2, tashqi bozor ε2=−4;</p><p>MC=30 (doimiy). Narxlarni toping.</p><p>Yechish.P1=30/(1−1/2)=60; P2=30/(1−1/4 )=40. Talab noelastikroq bo‘lgan ichki bozorda narx yuqori.</p><p>4-masala. Ikki qismli tarif: har bir iste’molchining talabi Q=20−P, MC=4. Bir xil 100 nafar iste’molchi bor. Optimal abonent to‘lovi va foydalanish narxini toping.</p><p>Yechish.p=MC=4; har bir iste’molchi Q=16 iste’mol qiladi; C S=0,5⋅16⋅16=128.</p><p>Abonent to‘lovi T=128; foyda 100⋅128=12800 (foydalanish to‘lovlari xarajatni qoplaydi).</p>"
