     "title": "9.10. Yechib ko‘rsatilgan masalalar",
     "html": "<div class=\"callout\"><p>1-masala. Quyidagi o‘yinda sof strategiyalardagi barcha Nesh muvozanatlarini</p></div><div class=\"callout\"><p>toping.</p></div><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>B: Chap</th><th>B: O‘rta</th><th>B: O‘ng</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A: Yuqori</td><td>3 / 1</td><td>2 / 4</td><td>5 / 2</td></tr><tr><td>A: Pastki</td><td>1 / 3</td><td>4 / 2</td><td>2 / 1</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Yechish. A ning eng yaxshi javoblari: Chap → Yuqori (3), O‘rta → Pastki (4), O‘ng → Yuqori (5). B ning eng yaxshi javoblari: Yuqori → O‘rta (4), Pastki → Chap (3). Ikkala tomondan belgilangan katak yo‘q – sof strategiyalarda Nesh muvozanati yo‘q. (O‘ng ustun B uchun O‘rtaga nisbatan dominantlashgan; uni chiqarsak, 2×2 o‘yin qoladi va aralash strategiyalarda muvozanat topiladi.) 2-masala. 1-masaladagi o‘yinda “O‘ng” ni chiqarib, aralash strategiyalardagi muvozanatni toping.</p><div class=\"tbl-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Yechish. A “Yuqori”ni p bilan, B “Chap”ni q bilan o‘ynasin. B befarqligi:</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1⋅p+3 (1−p)=4 p+2 (1−p), ya’ni</td><td>3−2 p=2+2 p,</td><td>p=0,25. A befarqligi:</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>3q+2 (1−q)=1⋅q+4 (1−q), ya’ni 2+q=4−3q, q=0,5. Muvozanat: A “Yuqori”ni 25%, B “Chap”ni 50% ehtimol bilan o‘ynaydi.</p><p>3-masala. Takrorlanadigan mahbus dilemmasida hamkorlik yutug‘i 6, bir tomonlama aldash yutug‘i 10, o‘zaro aldash yutug‘i 2. Trigger strategiyasida hamkorlik barqaror bo‘lishi uchun minimal δ ni toping.</p><p>Yechish.6/(1−δ )≥10+2δ/(1−δ ) → 6≥10 (1−δ )+2δ → 8δ ≥4 → δ ≥0,5.</p>"
